[{"id":3759805200,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7gGhMQ","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. Code looks good to me.\r\n\r\nI've double-checked that SSR roughness is still *mostly* resolution-independent. (It will still eventually decrease in roughness if the internal viewport resolution gets very low though.)\r\n\r\n### Scaling = 1.0, FSR2\r\n\r\n*Note that FSR2 applies its own mipmap LOD bias, similar to the **Texture Mipmap Bias** project setting. This bias affects screen-space reflections, which is probably a bug (similar to how it affects how reflection probes are sampled).*\r\n\r\nBefore | After\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"1919\" height=\"1078\" alt=\"Screenshot_20260205_233402\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ecd3a4b6-445e-435f-b9ab-c0948b5540f5\" /> | <img width=\"1919\" height=\"1078\" alt=\"Screenshot_20260205_233332\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a4a29667-1598-4031-b02a-2cabdbb3e05f\" />\r\n\r\n### Scaling = 0.5, FSR2\r\n\r\n*Note that FSR2 applies its own mipmap LOD bias, which is more significant at `0.5` scaling compared to `1.0`.*\r\n\r\nBefore | After\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"1919\" height=\"1078\" alt=\"Screenshot_20260205_233407\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/051cc092-cc48-4d58-95c8-d0eb500c93b3\" /> | <img width=\"1919\" height=\"1078\" alt=\"Screenshot_20260205_233342\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bc9b82c7-cf02-46f2-9cea-480f9d2183d4\" />\r\n","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115904#pullrequestreview-3759805200","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115904","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115904#pullrequestreview-3759805200"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115904"}},"submitted_at":"2026-02-05T22:37:07Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3759806101,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7gGhaV","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pul